      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOLAR HABIT (6) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 4.5 lengths away in third (22.62) at Murray Bridge in a Grade 3/4/5 over 395m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Good form should continue. RIVIA THEA (1) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (23.35) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Broken Hill. Safe beginner and drawn well on the inside. Can improve sharply here. LIFE'S A JOURNEY (2) has a strong record this track and trip including two wins from three starts. Was out of the placings last time (20.20) at Angle Park in a Other, finishing fifth and beaten 2.25 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. ARCHER TWELVE (8) is right in the mix.",
